---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="找不到頁面｜白沙岬燈塔旅遊指南" description="你要查看的頁面不存在。" noindex>
  <section class="grid min-h-[68svh] place-items-center bg-paper px-6 py-20 text-center">
    <div>
      <p class="text-8xl font-black tracking-[-.08em] text-ocean/20">404</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold">這條路沒有通往燈塔</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-ink/55">返回首頁，重新查看參觀資訊與海線行程。</p>
      <a class="focus-ring mt-8 inline-flex rounded-full bg-ocean px-6 py-3 text-sm font-extrabold text-white" href="/">回到白沙岬燈塔</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
